cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use REAL, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "REAL — Regular Expression Algorithmic Library"
abstract: "A header-only C++20 regular-expression engine with linear-time, ReDoS-safe matching and bounded lookarounds, a drop-in re-compatible Python binding, a Rust crate, and a std::regex-compatible layer that covers the POSIX grammars linearly."
